  <body>
    <sec>
      <title>Materials and Methods</title>
      <p>We stained sections with a rabbit anti-tyrosine hydroxylase antibody
      (RRID:AB_390204) from Millipore (Cat# AB152) and quantified images in FIJI
      (RRID:SCR_002285). Cells used were HEK293T (RRID:CVCL_0063). Sequencing
      data are deposited in the Gene Expression Omnibus (GSE12345).</p>
    </sec>
